NOTE ON SCOPE
=============

This MIT license covers the analysis code, JSON Schemas, comparator
implementations, statistical methods, derivation-chain output format, and
the vendored Bayesian conjugate kernel layer in this repository.

It does NOT cover the proprietary 2OPMD Ethos of Health (EoH) modules
referenced by stable interface from this repository: M2 Chronic Baseline Mode,
M3 Terrain Index Engine, M6 Escalation Router, M9 Reflex Suppression Core,
M62 Orbit Mode <-> Clinical Governance Handshake, and M63 GlassBox Derivation
Contract.

Those modules remain 2OPMD proprietary per CINDER PROTOCOL v3 §10. External
groups can reproduce the validation analyses on the released event outputs;
full mechanistic replication is available via the blinded external re-run
pathway described in protocol §10.
